      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "At the Morian Hall of Paleontology, visitors stroll beside complete dinosaur skeletons, including reconstructions of prehistoric giants that roamed Earth millions of years ago.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
